lls":[],"decisionMs":1232.6077499999956,"totalMs":1232.6185419999965,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":12,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1406.205375000005,"totalMs":1406.2149580000041,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1268.5669169999965,"totalMs":1268.5759169999947,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1211.1751250000016,"totalMs":1211.1844580000034,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1458.4820000000036,"totalMs":1720.616875000007,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I can't delete files directly from the camera. The latest clip is C0009.MP4—you'll need to remove it from your system after downloading.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":5},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":2562.6518339999966,"totalMs":2562.6670840000006,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":62,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"80% battery remaining.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1300.095208000006,"totalMs":1300.108125000006,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":7,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"ISO lowered to 1250 for a slightly darker image.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.33,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1730.674791000005,"totalMs":2172.813875,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":59,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1630.3693749999948,"totalMs":1919.5512089999975,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1294.5532919999969,"totalMs":1294.5686669999996,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1756.0375409999979,"totalMs":1756.0556250000009,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1592.7863329999964,"totalMs":1592.7961250000008,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Standing by for your next instruction.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1502.1632499999978,"totalMs":1502.1742079999967,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1611.8709999999992,"totalMs":1981.5812499999956,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The card contains four video clips:\n-